# lint-skill-script-refs.allow — known-pending script backbones.
#
# Each line is a normalized script ref (as it appears in a SKILL.md, minus any
# leading `./`) that lint-skill-script-refs.sh must NOT fail on, because the
# skill was absorbed into the base release ahead of its backbone script. Listing
# it here keeps the release gate green while keeping the gap auditable: the fix
# is to ship the script (or retire the skill), then delete the line.
#
# `#` comments and blank lines are ignored.

