# history. The /run-pipeline skill and the /handoff resume suggestion both point
# at it. Tracked for a follow-up project: build the pipeline orchestrator
# backbone or retire the skill. See workspace/reports/fix-2.7-missing-hooks-2026-08-11.md.
core/scripts/run-pipeline.sh
